,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-23T14:49:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T08:27:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121688","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121688.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121688.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Previously, FontFile resource is saved if it is unique to the scene or if resource was created manually (empty). Perhaps, FontFile resources can also be saved from GDScript after importing fonts.\r\n\r\nStoring FontFile cache entries in `.tscn` files causes very quick file increase (in 10s or 100s of MBs) when modifying font variation or theme properties (e.g. font size, embolden) and saving scene file. As far as I'm aware, automatic cache cleanup is only done in certain scenarios like replacing font file, and is not frequent enough to prevent scene file growing to tens or hundreds of megabytes. Furthermore, previously FontFile cache was included in VCS which is not ideal. This PR prevents saving FontFile cache to files.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120596\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTested in editor by reproducing original bug and changing various properties. I have not came up with any scenario where saving FontFile with cache entries provides value. However, there are many unwanted cases where accidentally making FontFile unique by missclicking on chain icon and not noticing, or making properties unique recursively would cause the described issue. Although I say `.tscn` files, the fix applies to FontFile resource saved to any file by Godot.\r\n\r\nFontFile import and cache was introduced in 4c3f7d1.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121688/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121688/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}